msgid "We have now backpropagated our target observable `obs` through the _entire_ circuit (**including** the `initial_state` which we placed on `slices[0]`) resulting in a new `SparsePauliOp` whose expectation value we obtain by projecting it on the _vacuum state_ (`|00...00>`).\n"
msgstr "Kini kita telah merambat balik observable sasaran kita `obs` melalui _keseluruhan_ litar (**termasuk** `initial_state` yang kita letakkan pada `slices[0]`) menghasilkan `SparsePauliOp` baharu yang nilai jangkaannya kita peroleh dengan memproyeksikannya pada _keadaan vakum_ (`|00...00>`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
