# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At this point, classically simulating the expectation value works exactly the same as before, just\n"
msgstr "Pada ketika ini, mensimulasikan nilai jangkaan secara klasik berfungsi dengan cara yang sama seperti sebelum ini, cuma\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We point out again, that multiple performance concerns should be considered.\n"
"Please go back to the [corresponding section above](#some-notes-on-performance).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami nyatakan sekali lagi bahawa beberapa kebimbangan prestasi perlu dipertimbangkan.\n"
"Sila kembali ke [bahagian yang sepadan di atas](#some-notes-on-performance).\n"
